    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>Azure Data Explorer&#39;s open source Kafka Connect Kusto sink connector has been enhanced from version 1.0 to include support for schema registry, configurable behavior on error, configurable retries, support for additional Kafka Connect converters, dead letter queue and improved reliability with &quot;At least Once&quot; delivery guarantees.&nbsp;The connector has passed stringent review for quality, best practices, standards and performance by Confluent, is now Confluent&nbsp;gold certified, and available in the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.confluent.io%2Fhub%2Fmicrosoftcorporation%2Fkafka-sink-azure-kusto&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cankhanol%40microsoft.com%7C014f2fa0e21346fda0e408d8503e3b9d%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637347575518308045&amp;sdata=hfgW5wf710aPR8O7ZVSTcMp6p7B3yo4D61%2Fjpcd71KU%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://www.confluent.io/hub/microsoftcorporation/kafka-sink-azure-kusto. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Confluent Connector Hub</a>.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>For more information:</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li>About the connector &amp; features, visit our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAzure%2Fkafka-sink-azure-kusto&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cankhanol%40microsoft.com%7C014f2fa0e21346fda0e408d8503e3b9d%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637347575518318041&amp;sdata=%2BxTF5b9jngY8kQkOUO9tMlwkZarVOeCbI4Q%2BqFAL2v0%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://github.com/Azure/kafka-sink-azure-kusto. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">git repo</a></li>\r\n\t<li>To test drive the connector, try out our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAzure%2Fazure-kusto-labs%2Fblob%2Fmaster%2Fkafka-integration%2FREADME.md&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cankhanol%40microsoft.com%7C014f2fa0e21346fda0e408d8503e3b9d%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637347575518318041&amp;sdata=3DwNA%2BebhkIrH5xqR17yMol6lnNahdiu7uF4IwbmnM8%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://github.com/Azure/azure-kusto-labs/blob/master/kafka-integration/README.md. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">hands on labs</a></li>\r\n\t<li>For&nbsp;reference architecture, review our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fdocs.microsoft.com%2Fen-us%2Fazure%2Farchitecture%2Fsolution-ideas%2Farticles%2Fbig-data-azure-data-explorer&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cankhanol%40microsoft.com%7C014f2fa0e21346fda0e408d8503e3b9d%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637347575518328033&amp;sdata=eaXg%2FKpgAFDPyPtJKBniI30v38%2FM5Daa4zFNtJWAeTg%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/architecture/solution-ideas/articles/big-data-azure-data-explorer. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Data Explorer centric big data analytics pattern</a>&nbsp;at the Azure architecture center</li>\r\n\t<li>For support with connector, log an&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAzure%2Fkafka-sink-azure-kusto%2Fissues&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cankhanol%40microsoft.com%7C014f2fa0e21346fda0e408d8503e3b9d%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637347575518328033&amp;sdata=8JHzVq%2BlMjUwnYuAT5HA2FWdsDMmn10boRzytDr7nAo%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://github.com/Azure/kafka-sink-azure-kusto/issues. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">issue</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Download the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAzure%2Fkafka-sink-azure-kusto%2Freleases&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cankhanol%40microsoft.com%7C014f2fa0e21346fda0e408d8503e3b9d%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637347575518338031&amp;sdata=Kg6NEqYVltpd1Ct9Gmw7Fq3yrPA0wM%2BDGLzUvBkMBFo%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://github.com/Azure/kafka-sink-azure-kusto/releases. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">latest release</a></li>\r\n\t<li>Try our&nbsp;<a href=\"https://nam06.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FAzure%2Fazure-kusto-labs%2Fblob%2Fmaster%2Fkafka-integration%2Fdockerized-quickstart%2FREADME.md&amp;data=02%7C01%7Cankhanol%40microsoft.com%7C014f2fa0e21346fda0e408d8503e3b9d%7C72f988bf86f141af91ab2d7cd011db47%7C1%7C0%7C637347575518338031&amp;sdata=O2pX51ZMRH0tv5c0uSfqJhZTNicUK4NaeM3wHdkELLQ%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL: https://github.com/Azure/azure-kusto-labs/blob/master/kafka-integration/dockerized-quickstart/README.md. Click or tap if you trust this link.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Docker based self-contained quick start</a>&nbsp;</li>\r\n\t<li>Read the <a href=\"https://techcommunity.microsoft.com/t5/azure-data-explorer/azure-data-explorer-kafka-connector-new-features-with-version-1/ba-p/1637143\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">release notes blog post</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure Data Explorer's open source Kafka Connect Kusto sink connector has been enhanced from version 1.0 to include support for schema registry, configurable behavior on error, configurable retries, support for additional Kafka Connect converters, dead letter queue and improved reliability with \"At least Once\" delivery guarantees. The connector has passed stringent review for quality, best practices, standards and performance by Confluent, is now Confluent gold certified, and available in the Confluent Connector Hub .\n\nFor more information:\n\nAbout the connector & features, visit our git repo\n\nTo test drive the connector, try out our hands on labs\n\nFor reference architecture, review our Azure Data Explorer centric big data analytics pattern at the Azure architecture center\n\nFor support with connector, log an issue\n\nDownload the latest release\n\nTry our Docker based self-contained quick start\n\nRead the release notes blog post"
